// Pronunciation overrides for the audiobook path.
//
// Written spelling on the left, how it should actually sound on the right. Applied to the
// spoken text only - never to the manuscript, never to an episode transcript.
//
// This file is read by render/render-book.mjs. An entry belongs here when a rendered chapter
// gets a word wrong: add the pair, rerun, and the fix applies to every chapter from then on.
// It is deliberately empty until a real render tells us what the model actually mispronounces,
// because guessing at pronunciation problems produces a list nobody maintains.
{
  "#1": "number one",
  "#2": "number two",
  "2SLGBTQI+": "two-S L G B T Q I plus"
}
